menuconfig BR2_PACKAGE_KF6
	bool "KF6"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_QT6
	help
	  This option enables the KF5 KDE Frameworks. Sub-options
	  allow to select which modules should be built.

	  https://techbase.kde.org/KDE_Frameworks

